0..77 Comment "// A map sending two points to one, ascribed an equivalence. `A ≃ B` is the"
78..151 Comment "// bi-invertible map, whose left inverse undoes the map at every point of"
152..226 Comment "// `A`; a map that collapses two points has no such inverse, and the round"
227..290 Comment "// trip claimed for one is refused at that field of the record."
